# Command Center

Shared config UI for persona onboarding, top-bar layout, presets/roles, and behavior styling. Data stored in `edminboost_settings['command_center']`.

## Class: `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center`

- `get_defaults()` / `get_settings()` — merged CC settings
- `get_nav_items()` — sub-nav tabs (Onboarding, Layout Studio, Presets & Roles, Behavior & Style)
- `get_personas()`, `get_system_presets()`, `get_all_presets()` — preset catalog
- `get_discovered_menu_items()` — scans global `$menu` for layout studio
- `get_assignable_roles()`, `get_badge_sources()`, `get_dashicon_options()` — UI option lists

Page slug suffixes: `PAGE_ONBOARDING` (`-onboarding`), `PAGE_MAPPER` (`-mapper`), `PAGE_PRESETS` (`-presets`), `PAGE_BEHAVIOR` (`-behavior`).

## Live Admin Bar: `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center_Bar`

Not a feature module — registered directly in `EDMINBOOST_Plugin::run()`.

- `register_nodes()` on `admin_bar_menu` (priority 80) — adds nodes from saved `top_bar_items` for the current user.
- `apply_declutter()` on `admin_bar_menu` (priority 999) — removes `wp-logo`, `comments`, `my-account`, `updates` per `behavior` toggles.
- `enqueue_assets()` on `admin_enqueue_scripts` and `wp_enqueue_scripts` — loads `edminboost-command-center-bar.css` + `dashicons` when `is_active()`.
- `is_active()` — plugin enabled, user logged in, admin bar showing, and `get_items_for_current_user()` non-empty.
- `get_items_for_current_user()` — filters items by `role_visibility` (hidden slugs per role).
- Node IDs: `edminboost-cc-{md5(slug)}`; meta class `edminboost-cc-bar-item`; badge markup `edminboost-cc-bar-badge edminboost-cc-bar-badge--{style}`.
- URLs: `admin_url( $slug )` for slugs; full `http(s)` URLs pass through `esc_url()`.

## Rendering

- Public entry points: `render_onboarding_page()`, `render_mapper_page()`, `render_presets_page()`, `render_behavior_page()` — each delegates to private `render_command_center_page( $partial )`.
- `render_command_center_page()` checks `EDMINBOOST_Settings::CAPABILITY`, sets `$cc_settings` + `$current_page`, includes the partial.
- All CC pages include `admin/partials/edminboost-command-center-nav.php`.
- Wrap in `.edminboost-wrap.edminboost-cc-wrap` (add `.edminboost-cc-wrap--wide` for mapper/presets).

## Settings API Forms

CC pages submit via `options.php` with `settings_fields( EDMINBOOST_Settings::SETTINGS_GROUP )`. Field names:

```
edminboost_settings[command_center][persona]
edminboost_settings[command_center][_layout_studio_save]   # marker: 1 when Layout Studio form submits
edminboost_settings[command_center][top_bar_items][0][slug|label|icon|interaction|badge_source]
edminboost_settings[command_center][role_assignments][role_key]
edminboost_settings[command_center][behavior][drawer_width|animation_speed|...]
```

Sanitization: `EDMINBOOST_Settings::sanitize_command_center()` (private) — whitelist personas, presets, icons, interactions, badge sources, behavior enums.

Layout Studio save: when `_layout_studio_save` is present, `top_bar_items` is always sanitized — an empty array clears the stored layout (fix for removing all items). Other CC pages omit this field so they do not overwrite `top_bar_items`.

Allowed values:

| Key | Values |
|-----|--------|
| `persona` | `client`, `ecommerce`, `developer` (empty = none) |
| `interaction` | `redirect`, `drawer` |
| `drawer_width` | `compact`, `standard`, `fullscreen` |
| `animation_speed` | `fast`, `normal`, `slow` |
| `badge_style` | `dot`, `pill`, `accent` |
| `badge_source` | `''`, `wc_orders`, `wc_reviews`, `comments`, `updates`, `forms_entries` |
| `autosave_interval` / `badge_refresh_rate` | integers, clamped 10–600 / 15–600 |

## Top Bar Item Shape

```php
array(
	'slug'         => 'edit.php',
	'label'        => 'Posts',
	'icon'         => 'dashicons-admin-post',
	'interaction'  => 'redirect', // or 'drawer'
	'badge_source' => '',         // key from get_badge_sources()
)
```

