## Rules

- Read settings via `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::get_settings()` — not raw `get_option()`.
- System presets (`system_client`, `system_ecommerce`, `system_developer`) are read-only; custom presets live in `command_center.presets`.
- `role_visibility` stores hidden slugs per role (inverted from visible checkboxes in UI).
- Mapper JS (`initMapper`) syncs visible canvas items to hidden inputs (`#edminboost-topbar-hidden-inputs`) before submit.
- Mapper UX: discovered rows are draggable to canvas; row click toggles checkbox (except handle/toggle areas); canvas and shell accept drops; `is-active` on discovered rows mirrors canvas membership.
- Badge sources (`wc_orders`, `comments`, `forms_entries`, etc.) are local counters only — no remote API calls.
